sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant Pipeline as Pipeline (canvodpy.api)
    participant Store as GnssResearchSite (store engine)
    participant VODCalc as TauOmegaZerothOrder
    participant Grid as GridData
    participant Viz as HemisphereVisualizer

    User->>Pipeline: Site("site").pipeline().calculate_vod("canopy", "reference", date)

    Pipeline->>Store: Load canopy dataset
    Store-->>Pipeline: Canopy Dataset (φ, θ, SNR)

    Pipeline->>Store: Load reference dataset
    Store-->>Pipeline: Reference Dataset (φ, θ, SNR)

    Pipeline->>VODCalc: TauOmegaZerothOrder(canopy_ds, reference_ds)

    VODCalc->>VODCalc: get_delta_snr()<br/>ΔSNR = SNR_canopy − SNR_sky
    VODCalc->>VODCalc: decibel2linear(ΔSNR)<br/>T = 10^(ΔSNR_dB / 10)
    VODCalc->>VODCalc: calculate_vod()<br/>τ = −ln(T) · cos(θ)

    VODCalc-->>Pipeline: VOD Dataset (τ per sid, epoch)

    Pipeline->>Grid: add_cell_ids_to_vod_fast(vod_ds, grid, grid_name)
    Grid->>Grid: KDTree query: (φ,θ) → cell_id
    Grid-->>Pipeline: Gridded VOD

    Pipeline->>Viz: HemisphereVisualizer(grid).plot_2d(gridded_vod)
    Viz-->>User: 📊 2D/3D Visualization

    Note over User,Viz: Complete VOD workflow<br/>from raw RINEX to visualization
